{"slug": "C_S03E19", "video_name": "Community - S03E19 - Curriculum Unavailable Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E19 - Curriculum Unavailable Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1273.957, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 558, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.048095238095238, "text": "Look at us, still together as a group"}, {"start": 3.048095238095238, "end": 6.92, "text": "even, what, two months after we're being kicked"}, {"start": 6.92, "end": 9.16, "text": "out of, you know, where?"}, {"start": 9.16, "end": 12.36, "text": "Yeah, good thing I came up with this idea for potluck dinners."}, {"start": 12.36, "end": 13.88, "text": "Here's all you said was, \"I'm hungry.\""}, {"start": 13.88, "end": 16.16, "text": "All Henry Ford said was, \"I need a ride.\""}, {"start": 16.16, "end": 18.44, "text": "Troy, is that a casserole?"}, {"start": 18.44, "end": 21.84, "text": "It's bagel bites and a deconstructed hot pocket reduction with a Doritos glaze."}, {"start": 21.84, "end": 24.4, "text": "I just really want to make my food, you know?"}, {"start": 24.4, "end": 27.24, "text": "Did anybody bring anything that isn't poison?"}, {"start": 27.24, "end": 32.32, "text": "I need to eat natural organic foods or I'm never going to get rid of this hangover."}, {"start": 32.32, "end": 34.92, "text": "Jeff, where'd you bring?"}, {"start": 34.92, "end": 37.0, "text": "Pack of life savers."}, {"start": 37.0, "end": 38.68, "text": "Sorry, dead battery."}, {"start": 38.68, "end": 39.76, "text": "Where's Abed?"}, {"start": 39.76, "end": 42.12, "text": "Have you seen Abed?"}, {"start": 42.12, "end": 46.8, "text": "Probably out getting something really cool for the dinner."}, {"start": 46.8, "end": 47.88, "text": "See, cool."}, {"start": 47.88, "end": 51.24, "text": "Abed brought delicious police."}, {"start": 51.24, "end": 53.2, "text": "Abed, what happened?"}, {"start": 53.2, "end": 54.69217391304348, "text": "Found your friend going through the dumpster"}, {"start": 54.69217391304348, "end": 56.32, "text": "outside the administration building in Greendale"}, {"start": 56.32, "end": 57.32, "text": "again."}, {"start": 57.32, "end": 61.72, "text": "This cadet could use a lesson in intergalactic protocol."}, {"start": 61.72, "end": 62.72, "text": "It's okay, officer."}, {"start": 62.72, "end": 64.32, "text": "He's just playing a character from TV."}, {"start": 64.32, "end": 66.88, "text": "Oh yes, I'm very familiar with Inspector Spacetime."}, {"start": 66.88, "end": 70.28, "text": "I think a guy becomes a cop because his prom night was a dream."}, {"start": 70.28, "end": 73.04, "text": "If this were Comic-Con, I'd take a bullet for that kid."}, {"start": 73.04, "end": 75.76, "text": "But here in the real world, trespassing is a crime."}, {"start": 75.76, "end": 77.12, "text": "We're sorry, officer."}, {"start": 77.12, "end": 82.16, "text": "Our friend has been having a hard time adjusting to being expelled from Greendale."}, {"start": 82.16, "end": 83.6, "text": "It won't happen again."}, {"start": 83.6, "end": 84.6, "text": "That's for sure."}, {"start": 84.6, "end": 86.08, "text": "I talked to your former dean."}, {"start": 86.08, "end": 87.64, "text": "I recommend that he press charges."}, {"start": 87.64, "end": 91.4, "text": "He said he'd hold off on the condition that you set an appointment with this guy."}, {"start": 91.4, "end": 93.88, "text": "He's offering to foot the bill for the consultation himself."}, {"start": 93.88, "end": 95.28, "text": "It's the number for a psychiatrist."}, {"start": 95.28, "end": 96.28, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 96.28, "end": 97.28, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 97.28, "end": 98.28, "text": "Abed's not crazy."}, {"start": 98.28, "end": 99.28, "text": "Where does the dean get off?"}, {"start": 99.28, "end": 100.28, "text": "He's not the real dean."}, {"start": 100.28, "end": 104.04, "text": "He's been replaced by an identical life form for some nefarious purpose."}, {"start": 104.04, "end": 105.04, "text": "Reggie to the time booth."}, {"start": 105.04, "end": 108.2, "text": "We haven't much space."}, {"start": 108.2, "end": 109.76, "text": "I'll be right there, Inspector."}, {"start": 109.76, "end": 112.0293023255814, "text": "Hey, before I go, you really shouldn't be"}, {"start": 112.0293023255814, "end": 114.52, "text": "using this to prop open your building's door."}, {"start": 114.52, "end": 117.59280898876405, "text": "This is an antique firebrick, I'd say, pre-Civil War,"}, {"start": 117.59280898876405, "end": 119.68, "text": "a note the uneven orange hue and the"}, {"start": 119.68, "end": 121.88, "text": "embossment on the back."}, {"start": 121.88, "end": 123.48, "text": "Quite a nifty little piece of Americana."}, {"start": 123.48, "end": 127.28, "text": "You could get 50, 60 bucks for it from the right collector."}, {"start": 127.28, "end": 129.76, "text": "I watch a lot of Antiques Roadshow."}, {"start": 129.76, "end": 134.44, "text": "Anyway, walk to your cars and pairs tonight."}, {"start": 134.44, "end": 138.0, "text": "Rapes up 8%."}, {"start": 138.0, "end": 141.72, "text": "Sixty dollars?"}, {"start": 141.72, "end": 143.72, "text": "Hello, rich people?"}, {"start": 143.72, "end": 144.72, "text": "Always joining you."}, {"start": 144.72, "end": 145.72, "text": "Yes, I'll hold."}, {"start": 145.72, "end": 146.72, "text": "Give me some more sometime in a dream."}, {"start": 146.72, "end": 147.72, "text": "Give me the hope to run out of steam."}, {"start": 147.72, "end": 148.72, "text": "Somebody say we can be here."}, {"start": 148.72, "end": 149.72, "text": "We can roll the tide up dead again."}, {"start": 149.72, "end": 150.72, "text": "I can't count the reasons I should stay."}, {"start": 150.72, "end": 150.72, "text": "Walk by one, they are just fading away."}, {"start": 179.538, "end": 181.59063157894738, "text": "Abed, I'm Dr."}, {"start": 181.59063157894738, "end": 182.538, "text": "Heidi."}, {"start": 182.538, "end": 184.538, "text": "We're going to have a little chat tonight, you and I."}, {"start": 184.538, "end": 185.538, "text": "How does that sound?"}, {"start": 185.538, "end": 186.538, "text": "I don't need therapy."}, {"start": 186.538, "end": 188.538, "text": "Well, that's a perfectly normal response."}, {"start": 188.538, "end": 189.50942857142857, "text": "I concur with Dr."}, {"start": 189.50942857142857, "end": 190.538, "text": "Heidi's diagnosis."}, {"start": 190.538, "end": 192.538, "text": "I haven't diagnosed anything yet."}, {"start": 192.538, "end": 195.538, "text": "Psych major, got your back, brah."}, {"start": 195.538, "end": 200.538, "text": "I have to say, I didn't expect to see so many of you."}, {"start": 200.538, "end": 203.538, "text": "Abed won't go to any kind of doctor on his own."}, {"start": 203.538, "end": 205.538, "text": "We caught him last year trying to remove his own tonsils."}, {"start": 205.538, "end": 207.538, "text": "Well, why don't you let me take it from here?"}, {"start": 207.538, "end": 208.538, "text": "You have to understand about Abed."}, {"start": 208.538, "end": 210.538, "text": "He's usually, you know, adorable weird."}, {"start": 210.538, "end": 211.538, "text": "Like, mork for mork."}, {"start": 211.538, "end": 214.538, "text": "But since we got expelled, he's been creepy weird."}, {"start": 214.538, "end": 215.538, "text": "Like, present-day Robin Williams."}, {"start": 215.538, "end": 216.538, "text": "I'm not crazy."}, {"start": 216.538, "end": 219.538, "text": "Well, Abed, I don't deal in crazy."}, {"start": 219.538, "end": 221.538, "text": "I deal in help."}, {"start": 221.538, "end": 224.538, "text": "So how long has Abed needed a crazy amount of help?"}, {"start": 224.538, "end": 228.538, "text": "All of this behavior started after you were expelled?"}, {"start": 232.932, "end": 236.932, "text": "There may have been a ramp up."}, {"start": 239.932, "end": 240.78199999999998, "text": "It's okay, buddy."}, {"start": 240.78199999999998, "end": 241.932, "text": "Just a few more minutes"}, {"start": 241.932, "end": 242.932, "text": "and we're good until spring, okay?"}, {"start": 242.932, "end": 244.932, "text": "But it doesn't make any sense."}, {"start": 244.932, "end": 245.932, "text": "Think of it this way."}, {"start": 245.932, "end": 248.932, "text": "We'll get the hour back later in the year."}, {"start": 250.932, "end": 252.932, "text": "I rented Tower Heist last night."}, {"start": 252.932, "end": 254.932, "text": "Now, when I spoil the ending, let me tell you,"}, {"start": 254.932, "end": 256.932, "text": "it was quite the hilarious field ride."}, {"start": 256.932, "end": 257.932, "text": "That red rattler?"}, {"start": 257.932, "end": 260.932, "text": "He's a master at comedic action adventure."}, {"start": 260.932, "end": 262.932, "text": "A master at storytelling."}, {"start": 262.932, "end": 264.932, "text": "He's just a master at making movies in general."}, {"start": 264.932, "end": 265.3836129032258, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 265.3836129032258, "end": 265.932, "text": "I'm gonna say it."}, {"start": 265.932, "end": 267.932, "text": "He's the new Spielberg."}, {"start": 270.932, "end": 272.932, "text": "I have to go."}, {"start": 273.932, "end": 275.932, "text": "You're a bad person."}, {"start": 275.932, "end": 277.932, "text": "You're a bad person."}, {"start": 277.932, "end": 279.932, "text": "Time enough at last to eat a sandwich,"}, {"start": 283.25100000000003, "end": 285.25100000000003, "text": "though even he knew that this sandwich"}, {"start": 285.25100000000003, "end": 287.25100000000003, "text": "was nearer his last sandwich than his first."}, {"start": 287.25100000000003, "end": 288.25100000000003, "text": "Abed, I'm trying to eat."}, {"start": 288.25100000000003, "end": 290.25100000000003, "text": "He said, oldly, his brittle bones straining"}, {"start": 290.25100000000003, "end": 293.25100000000003, "text": "to support the weight of his wrinkly skin."}, {"start": 294.25100000000003, "end": 296.25100000000003, "text": "Stop narrating me."}, {"start": 296.25100000000003, "end": 298.25100000000003, "text": "He shouted to no one, just a man,"}, {"start": 298.25100000000003, "end": 300.25100000000003, "text": "alone in time with nothing but the cold squishiness"}, {"start": 300.25100000000003, "end": 302.25100000000003, "text": "of tuna salad to comfort him."}, {"start": 302.25100000000003, "end": 303.25100000000003, "text": "Take it back."}, {"start": 303.25100000000003, "end": 305.25100000000003, "text": "I don't want to be in your novel."}, {"start": 305.25100000000003, "end": 307.25100000000003, "text": "Fierce Rothorn had nearly lost his grip on reality."}, {"start": 307.25100000000003, "end": 309.25100000000003, "text": "Lately, he began to think that he was in a novel."}, {"start": 309.25100000000003, "end": 310.17407692307694, "text": "And..."}, {"start": 310.17407692307694, "end": 311.25100000000003, "text": "action."}, {"start": 312.25100000000003, "end": 314.25100000000003, "text": "Abed, what the hell are you doing?"}, {"start": 314.25100000000003, "end": 314.4862941176471, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 314.4862941176471, "end": 315.07452941176473, "text": "We got it."}, {"start": 315.07452941176473, "end": 316.25100000000003, "text": "One more for safety."}, {"start": 316.25100000000003, "end": 319.25100000000003, "text": "Abed, it's 4.30 in the morning, and you're in my bedroom."}, {"start": 319.25100000000003, "end": 320.25100000000003, "text": "Use that, okay."}, {"start": 320.25100000000003, "end": 321.17407692307694, "text": "And..."}, {"start": 321.17407692307694, "end": 322.25100000000003, "text": "action."}, {"start": 322.25100000000003, "end": 324.25100000000003, "text": "But that's almost completely nearly all of it."}, {"start": 324.25100000000003, "end": 327.25100000000003, "text": "If Abed is as sick as you all say, then I have--"}, {"start": 327.25100000000003, "end": 328.25100000000003, "text": "Wait a minute."}, {"start": 328.25100000000003, "end": 331.25100000000003, "text": "Nobody in this room gets to define \"sick.\""}, {"start": 331.25100000000003, "end": 333.25100000000003, "text": "I'm a psychiatrist."}, {"start": 333.25100000000003, "end": 334.3621111111111, "text": "Any kind of Dr."}, {"start": 334.3621111111111, "end": 335.25100000000003, "text": "Kim, really."}, {"start": 335.25100000000003, "end": 336.25100000000003, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 336.25100000000003, "end": 339.25100000000003, "text": "Well, if Abed's sick, then we're all sick."}, {"start": 339.25100000000003, "end": 340.25100000000003, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 340.25100000000003, "end": 343.25100000000003, "text": "Kids determine a person's sanity from a few amusing stories."}, {"start": 343.25100000000003, "end": 344.25100000000003, "text": "This is right."}, {"start": 344.25100000000003, "end": 347.25100000000003, "text": "If anything, Abed's more sane than any of us."}, {"start": 348.25100000000003, "end": 351.25100000000003, "text": "He's certainly the craziest one of us,"}, {"start": 351.25100000000003, "end": 356.25100000000003, "text": "but, you know, we're all kind of crazy-town banana pants."}, {"start": 356.25100000000003, "end": 358.25100000000003, "text": "Talk to me about crazy-town banana pants."}, {"start": 358.25100000000003, "end": 361.25100000000003, "text": "Look, we're just saying, it's been a crazy year for everybody."}, {"start": 361.25100000000003, "end": 364.25100000000003, "text": "Who among us hasn't had the odd banana in his or her pants, right?"}, {"start": 364.25100000000003, "end": 365.25100000000003, "text": "I have."}, {"start": 370.25100000000003, "end": 372.25100000000003, "text": "How long does peyote last?"}, {"start": 375.817, "end": 377.817, "text": "Just asking for a friend."}, {"start": 377.817, "end": 380.817, "text": "♪ Tryin' out at it any in the mornin' ♪"}, {"start": 380.817, "end": 382.817, "text": "What are you doing?"}, {"start": 382.817, "end": 383.817, "text": "Nothing."}, {"start": 383.817, "end": 384.817, "text": "Nothing, my ass."}, {"start": 384.817, "end": 386.817, "text": "What are all these cameras doing here?"}, {"start": 391.817, "end": 393.817, "text": "Here, take my coat."}, {"start": 395.817, "end": 396.817, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 396.817, "end": 398.817, "text": "You're sweet."}, {"start": 399.817, "end": 401.817, "text": "Just don't eat anything or drink anything."}, {"start": 401.817, "end": 402.817, "text": "And no sweating."}, {"start": 402.817, "end": 406.817, "text": "Or bending of the elbows and no chairs with backrests."}, {"start": 406.817, "end": 408.817, "text": "And if you take it off, a wooden hanger's over."}, {"start": 411.817, "end": 413.817, "text": "You're probably warm now, right?"}, {"start": 417.817, "end": 418.68186486486485, "text": "Good news, guys."}, {"start": 418.68186486486485, "end": 419.817, "text": "I spent all my money."}, {"start": 419.817, "end": 420.05942424242426, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 420.05942424242426, "end": 421.817, "text": "You can't bring that in here."}, {"start": 421.817, "end": 422.44557142857144, "text": "Yes, I can."}, {"start": 422.44557142857144, "end": 423.817, "text": "It's all terrain, dummy."}, {"start": 423.817, "end": 426.817, "text": "I made a plate of cookies for the study group, but my boys ate them."}, {"start": 426.817, "end": 430.817, "text": "Just as they took something of yours, you all get something of theirs."}, {"start": 430.817, "end": 431.817, "text": "Elijah loves this, Britta."}, {"start": 431.817, "end": 433.317, "text": "Here you go, Jeff."}, {"start": 433.317, "end": 434.817, "text": "Here you go, Troy."}, {"start": 435.817, "end": 437.817, "text": "Karate Championship second place."}, {"start": 438.817, "end": 440.817, "text": "Now be unstoppable."}, {"start": 442.817, "end": 444.817, "text": "So you see what you call insanity?"}, {"start": 444.817, "end": 446.817, "text": "We call solidarity."}, {"start": 446.817, "end": 447.817, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 447.817, "end": 451.817, "text": "You just finished telling him about it and you grab it and squeeze it?"}, {"start": 451.817, "end": 452.817, "text": "I said I was sorry."}, {"start": 452.817, "end": 453.238686746988, "text": "Uh-huh."}, {"start": 453.238686746988, "end": 457.817, "text": "And so as a group, do you always indulge Abed in these little misadventures?"}, {"start": 457.817, "end": 459.1503333333333, "text": "Take that back."}, {"start": 459.1503333333333, "end": 461.817, "text": "Our adventures are very manly."}, {"start": 461.817, "end": 463.817, "text": "Whoa, that's fantastic."}, {"start": 463.817, "end": 467.817, "text": "I have to say there's nothing more important to mental health than a support system."}, {"start": 467.817, "end": 471.817, "text": "And assuming that this group is for Abed's said support system,"}, {"start": 471.817, "end": 475.817, "text": "I think I've heard everything I need to hear in order to make a decision."}, {"start": 475.817, "end": 477.817, "text": "I think that Abed should be committed."}, {"start": 479.817, "end": 482.55985714285714, "text": "You mean committed to his character work, right?"}, {"start": 482.55985714285714, "end": 483.817, "text": "Because he already is."}, {"start": 483.817, "end": 485.817, "text": "Abed, show him you're Don Draper."}, {"start": 485.817, "end": 486.817, "text": "Cigarettes."}, {"start": 487.817, "end": 489.817, "text": "No, I mean an institution."}, {"start": 489.817, "end": 491.817, "text": "You mean like marriage?"}, {"start": 491.817, "end": 493.817, "text": "I mean a mental institution."}, {"start": 493.817, "end": 494.44857894736845, "text": "Ah, so do I."}, {"start": 494.44857894736845, "end": 496.817, "text": "Will someone please help me lighten the mood?"}, {"start": 501.817, "end": 502.5343913043478, "text": "Please, Mr."}, {"start": 502.5343913043478, "end": 507.817, "text": "Doctor, psychiatrist, sir, please don't send my best friend to crazy people jail."}, {"start": 507.817, "end": 509.6503333333333, "text": "Relax, he doesn't have the right."}, {"start": 509.6503333333333, "end": 510.817, "text": "Abed's not dangerous."}, {"start": 510.817, "end": 514.817, "text": "Yeah, he's just unique, like a snowflake who gets bent out of shape"}, {"start": 514.817, "end": 516.817, "text": "when you mix up Star Wars and space tricks."}, {"start": 516.817, "end": 518.6680638297872, "text": "Or a serial killer signature."}, {"start": 518.6680638297872, "end": 519.817, "text": "I'm a psych major."}, {"start": 519.817, "end": 522.3701914893617, "text": "His continued obsession with Greendale Community"}, {"start": 522.3701914893617, "end": 524.817, "text": "College suggests the potential for escalation."}, {"start": 524.817, "end": 527.817, "text": "And frankly, these stories you've been telling me are very troubling."}, {"start": 527.817, "end": 528.5789047619048, "text": "You're troubled?"}, {"start": 528.5789047619048, "end": 530.817, "text": "I don't remember any of those things happening."}, {"start": 530.817, "end": 532.817, "text": "Since when do these three live together?"}, {"start": 532.817, "end": 535.817, "text": "Look, Abed's obsession with Greendale doesn't make him crazy."}, {"start": 535.817, "end": 537.817, "text": "If you had gone to school there, you'd be obsessed with it too."}, {"start": 537.817, "end": 539.646268292683, "text": "It was a messed up place."}, {"start": 539.646268292683, "end": 540.817, "text": "We have lockers."}, {"start": 540.817, "end": 542.817, "text": "Yeah, we're survivors."}, {"start": 544.817, "end": 547.2016153846154, "text": "My name is Professor Wabenswim."}, {"start": 547.2016153846154, "end": 548.817, "text": "Who's ready to learn?"}, {"start": 548.817, "end": 549.2117368421053, "text": "Dean!"}, {"start": 549.2117368421053, "end": 553.7117368421053, "text": "This is not the way to agree on parking for the job fair."}, {"start": 553.7117368421053, "end": 554.817, "text": "It's inhumane."}, {"start": 554.817, "end": 556.817, "text": "You have a better idea, Britta?"}, {"start": 556.817, "end": 558.817, "text": "Yes, thousands of them."}, {"start": 559.817, "end": 561.817, "text": "Vicky to queen three."}, {"start": 562.817, "end": 564.817, "text": "Nate!"}, {"start": 569.817, "end": 571.9708461538462, "text": "That's all for today."}, {"start": 571.9708461538462, "end": 573.817, "text": "Reach out to four."}, {"start": 576.817, "end": 579.817, "text": "Okay, we just can't ignore that."}, {"start": 590.817, "end": 591.442, "text": "- Bananas?"}, {"start": 591.442, "end": 591.817, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 591.817, "end": 592.9598571428571, "text": "- Toast?"}, {"start": 592.9598571428571, "end": 593.817, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 593.817, "end": 594.4836666666666, "text": "- Bubblegum?"}, {"start": 594.4836666666666, "end": 594.817, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 594.817, "end": 596.1111176470588, "text": "- Pancakes?"}, {"start": 596.1111176470588, "end": 596.817, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 596.817, "end": 597.7058888888889, "text": "- Fries?"}, {"start": 597.7058888888889, "end": 598.817, "text": "- Get out."}, {"start": 599.817, "end": 601.817, "text": "Get out."}, {"start": 601.817, "end": 603.1439230769231, "text": "There's one every year."}, {"start": 603.1439230769231, "end": 604.817, "text": "I will not tolerate clowning."}, {"start": 604.817, "end": 606.1111176470588, "text": "- Car keys?"}, {"start": 606.1111176470588, "end": 606.817, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 606.817, "end": 608.3464117647059, "text": "Okay, last bathroom break."}, {"start": 608.3464117647059, "end": 609.817, "text": "We have got to cram for--"}, {"start": 611.817, "end": 613.1405294117648, "text": "Excuse me, sir?"}, {"start": 613.1405294117648, "end": 614.817, "text": "Can we get to our--"}, {"start": 616.817, "end": 619.1639387755102, "text": "Sell your bones, Rufus."}, {"start": 619.1639387755102, "end": 621.817, "text": "We have all rolled to one."}, {"start": 622.817, "end": 624.817, "text": "Welcome..."}, {"start": 628.817, "end": 630.817, "text": "to Ladders."}, {"start": 632.817, "end": 634.817, "text": "Interesting."}, {"start": 637.02, "end": 638.76, "text": "Just wanna see if we got the same thing."}, {"start": 638.76, "end": 640.8, "text": "- It sounds as though this Greendale"}, {"start": 640.8, "end": 642.9399999999999, "text": "had quite an effect on all of you."}, {"start": 642.9399999999999, "end": 645.12, "text": "You should all definitely stop dwelling on it"}, {"start": 645.12, "end": 645.96, "text": "if you wanna be healthy."}, {"start": 645.96, "end": 648.6, "text": "- Well, come on, it wasn't all bad."}, {"start": 648.6, "end": 650.68, "text": "I was there longer than anybody and I'm fine."}, {"start": 650.68, "end": 651.84, "text": "How are you?"}, {"start": 651.84, "end": 653.3199999999999, "text": "What do you ask, 3.30?"}, {"start": 654.8199999999999, "end": 655.64, "text": "- Uh oh."}, {"start": 655.64, "end": 656.48, "text": "- What Pierce was saying"}, {"start": 656.48, "end": 658.72, "text": "before he started sundowning is true."}, {"start": 658.72, "end": 661.1999999999999, "text": "We can't just pass the crazy buck to Greendale."}, {"start": 661.1999999999999, "end": 662.72, "text": "It could be a good place too."}, {"start": 662.72, "end": 663.84, "text": "- That really doesn't matter."}, {"start": 663.84, "end": 665.24, "text": "- Yeah, we have a lot of memories"}, {"start": 665.24, "end": 666.76, "text": "of Greendale being in our corner."}, {"start": 666.76, "end": 667.92, "text": "- Dena Ling."}, {"start": 667.92, "end": 669.6, "text": "- I just wanted to drop by and tell y'all"}, {"start": 669.6, "end": 671.84, "text": "we ought to be hot steppin' it out of the parking lot"}, {"start": 671.84, "end": 674.0799999999999, "text": "in a brisk, but orderly fashion."}, {"start": 674.0799999999999, "end": 675.0, "text": "- Is there a fire drill?"}, {"start": 675.0, "end": 676.8199999999999, "text": "- No sir, there's an actual fire."}, {"start": 676.8199999999999, "end": 678.3199999999999, "text": "I wanted you guys to be the first to know"}, {"start": 678.3199999999999, "end": 679.56, "text": "before I tell everyone else."}, {"start": 679.56, "end": 681.5, "text": "I know, it's not right to play favorites,"}, {"start": 681.5, "end": 683.0799999999999, "text": "but it's no more right to settle in your feelings"}, {"start": 683.0799999999999, "end": 684.72, "text": "and I don't know what I'd do without you guys."}, {"start": 684.72, "end": 688.48, "text": "Whoa, okay, fire, fire, that's a fire!"}, {"start": 697.437, "end": 699.2570000000001, "text": "- Darcy, you've got a cold."}, {"start": 699.2570000000001, "end": 701.157, "text": "You're sick, go home!"}, {"start": 701.157, "end": 705.317, "text": "Get out of here, get out of here, get out of here!"}, {"start": 705.317, "end": 707.437, "text": "- Can't believe we got here too late for pizza."}, {"start": 707.437, "end": 708.9970000000001, "text": "- Worst pizza day ever."}, {"start": 708.9970000000001, "end": 710.7370000000001, "text": "- Oh darn it."}, {"start": 710.7370000000001, "end": 714.677, "text": "What am I gonna do with all this garbage?"}, {"start": 715.957, "end": 718.517, "text": "- It's me, the team."}, {"start": 718.517, "end": 721.397, "text": "I pulled the last six pieces of pizza for you."}, {"start": 724.6370000000001, "end": 726.9970000000001, "text": "- Back to garbage detail."}, {"start": 726.9970000000001, "end": 729.2370000000001, "text": "We have a few students with birthdays today,"}, {"start": 729.2370000000001, "end": 731.437, "text": "but hey, why single them out?"}, {"start": 731.437, "end": 732.397, "text": "- What about the students"}, {"start": 732.397, "end": 734.2370000000001, "text": "who aren't celebrating anything at all?"}, {"start": 734.2370000000001, "end": 736.777, "text": "Are they any less special?"}, {"start": 738.777, "end": 742.397, "text": "Troy and Jeffrey and Annie and Britta"}, {"start": 742.397, "end": 746.157, "text": "and Shirley and Pierce and Abed and Jeffrey,"}, {"start": 746.157, "end": 750.157, "text": "just a few of the most special students in the world."}, {"start": 754.317, "end": 755.957, "text": "- Damn it, out of slugs."}, {"start": 755.957, "end": 757.557, "text": "Next time I'll put you square,"}, {"start": 757.557, "end": 759.557, "text": "you pickle sucking, McGillicuddy."}, {"start": 762.277, "end": 763.557, "text": "- Why did you save me, Dean?"}, {"start": 763.557, "end": 767.077, "text": "- I know how important paintball is to you, Abed."}, {"start": 767.077, "end": 768.157, "text": "I wanted you to win."}, {"start": 768.157, "end": 769.6370000000001, "text": "- It's not important anymore."}, {"start": 769.6370000000001, "end": 770.8770000000001, "text": "I get it now."}, {"start": 770.8770000000001, "end": 773.197, "text": "It just feels forced."}, {"start": 773.197, "end": 775.597, "text": "You just enjoy your prize."}, {"start": 775.597, "end": 777.797, "text": "Free tickets to (coughs)"}, {"start": 777.797, "end": 782.297, "text": "to see Chicago at the Greendale Civic Center with (coughs)"}, {"start": 782.297, "end": 786.437, "text": "George Wendt and (coughs)"}, {"start": 786.437, "end": 788.457, "text": "- Stephanie Powers."}, {"start": 792.117, "end": 792.957, "text": "- Me!"}, {"start": 797.437, "end": 799.397, "text": "- Okay, that was great,"}, {"start": 799.397, "end": 801.277, "text": "but you really didn't need to go into it."}, {"start": 801.277, "end": 803.397, "text": "- You know what occurs to me?"}, {"start": 803.397, "end": 805.9970000000001, "text": "What all those great Greendale memories have in common?"}, {"start": 805.9970000000001, "end": 806.917, "text": "- I was barely in them."}, {"start": 806.917, "end": 808.557, "text": "- They were all about Dean Poulton."}, {"start": 808.557, "end": 809.837, "text": "- That's what I've been trying to make you guys understand"}, {"start": 809.837, "end": 811.537, "text": "for the last two months."}, {"start": 811.537, "end": 813.917, "text": "I keep telling you, we weren't expelled by the real Dean."}, {"start": 813.917, "end": 814.857, "text": "Couldn't have been him."}, {"start": 814.857, "end": 815.697, "text": "He loved us."}, {"start": 815.697, "end": 817.357, "text": "- Maybe we've been so concerned"}, {"start": 817.357, "end": 818.6370000000001, "text": "with moving past Greendale."}, {"start": 818.6370000000001, "end": 820.117, "text": "We've been living in denials."}, {"start": 820.117, "end": 820.957, "text": "- It's true."}, {"start": 821.797, "end": 822.6370000000001, "text": "I mean, let's face it."}, {"start": 822.6370000000001, "end": 825.117, "text": "We weren't driven crazy by Greendale,"}, {"start": 825.117, "end": 827.6370000000001, "text": "and Abed's not the crazy one for obsessing about it."}, {"start": 828.577, "end": 829.917, "text": "Abed, we're sorry."}, {"start": 829.917, "end": 831.2370000000001, "text": "We haven't been supporting you,"}, {"start": 831.2370000000001, "end": 832.957, "text": "and we haven't been honest with ourselves."}, {"start": 832.957, "end": 833.1140909090909, "text": "Dr."}, {"start": 833.1140909090909, "end": 835.837, "text": "Heide, something weird is going on with that school."}, {"start": 835.837, "end": 837.457, "text": "Abed doesn't need to be here."}, {"start": 837.457, "end": 838.457, "text": "We need to be there."}, {"start": 840.517, "end": 842.197, "text": "- But there is no there."}, {"start": 842.197, "end": 843.4770000000001, "text": "- That's the problem."}, {"start": 843.4770000000001, "end": 844.557, "text": "That's why we have to go back."}, {"start": 844.557, "end": 846.837, "text": "- No, you can't go back to Greendale."}, {"start": 846.837, "end": 847.677, "text": "- Why?"}, {"start": 847.677, "end": 848.517, "text": "Because it isn't healthy?"}, {"start": 848.517, "end": 849.937, "text": "- 'Cause it doesn't exist."}, {"start": 853.357, "end": 855.117, "text": "- Park by a meter."}, {"start": 855.117, "end": 856.417, "text": "Maybe I'll park by a meter."}, {"start": 857.777, "end": 858.777, "text": "- Wait, what?"}, {"start": 864.357, "end": 866.2370000000001, "text": "- What do you mean Greendale doesn't exist?"}, {"start": 866.2370000000001, "end": 868.437, "text": "- Well, there is a place called Greendale,"}, {"start": 868.437, "end": 870.917, "text": "and you all spent three years there,"}, {"start": 870.917, "end": 873.777, "text": "but it was not a community college."}, {"start": 875.117, "end": 877.457, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 878.557, "end": 881.8770000000001, "text": "- These memories that you people have been sharing"}, {"start": 881.8770000000001, "end": 883.697, "text": "are a shared psychosis."}, {"start": 885.077, "end": 886.317, "text": "You were patients there together,"}, {"start": 886.317, "end": 887.157, "text": "you were released together,"}, {"start": 887.157, "end": 891.9970000000001, "text": "and I'm alarmed to see that you are now relapsing together."}, {"start": 891.9970000000001, "end": 893.677, "text": "- No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no."}, {"start": 893.677, "end": 895.717, "text": "This is not real."}, {"start": 895.717, "end": 896.677, "text": "You're lying."}, {"start": 896.677, "end": 899.917, "text": "- Search your mind for the real memories."}, {"start": 899.917, "end": 902.517, "text": "Try to look past the trauma that you've been blocking out."}, {"start": 902.517, "end": 903.4770000000001, "text": "- What trauma?"}, {"start": 903.4770000000001, "end": 906.777, "text": "- You all came to this community college"}, {"start": 906.777, "end": 909.597, "text": "after your last fractured pill addiction."}, {"start": 909.597, "end": 910.9970000000001, "text": "Failed legal career."}, {"start": 910.9970000000001, "end": 912.277, "text": "Broken marriage."}, {"start": 912.277, "end": 914.317, "text": "Lost scholarship."}, {"start": 914.317, "end": 915.157, "text": "Old."}, {"start": 915.157, "end": 915.9970000000001, "text": "- Enough!"}, {"start": 915.9970000000001, "end": 917.317, "text": "I don't want to hear mine."}, {"start": 917.317, "end": 919.537, "text": "And if we were going to fabricate a delusion,"}, {"start": 919.537, "end": 922.277, "text": "why would we fabricate a community college?"}, {"start": 922.277, "end": 923.7570000000001, "text": "- Ah, yes."}, {"start": 923.7570000000001, "end": 926.2370000000001, "text": "This fantastical community college"}, {"start": 926.2370000000001, "end": 929.397, "text": "where everything that happens is unbelievably ridiculous"}, {"start": 929.397, "end": 932.517, "text": "and it all revolves around you as a group."}, {"start": 932.517, "end": 935.4098571428572, "text": "The same reason anyone plunges into psychosis, Ms."}, {"start": 935.4098571428572, "end": 935.7570000000001, "text": "Perry."}, {"start": 935.7570000000001, "end": 937.797, "text": "It was a mentally compatible alternative"}, {"start": 937.797, "end": 939.857, "text": "to your grim reality."}, {"start": 939.857, "end": 942.777, "text": "(thunder rumbling)"}, {"start": 945.4770000000001, "end": 947.7170000000001, "text": "- Can't you believe this secret trampoline we found?"}, {"start": 947.7170000000001, "end": 949.9970000000001, "text": "- Oh no, it's so great."}, {"start": 949.9970000000001, "end": 952.2570000000001, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 958.117, "end": 959.537, "text": "- For Greendell!"}, {"start": 959.537, "end": 960.377, "text": "- Search!"}, {"start": 961.597, "end": 963.037, "text": "- Come on, Leonard!"}, {"start": 963.037, "end": 963.877, "text": "- No!"}, {"start": 963.877, "end": 964.7170000000001, "text": "- Oh!"}, {"start": 964.7170000000001, "end": 966.397, "text": "♪ Baby, do the center ♪"}, {"start": 966.397, "end": 968.577, "text": "♪ Take it wherever it is ♪"}, {"start": 968.577, "end": 969.417, "text": "- You're welcome!"}, {"start": 969.417, "end": 972.877, "text": "You're welcome for everything in the world!"}, {"start": 972.877, "end": 973.877, "text": "- Terry, stop."}, {"start": 973.877, "end": 975.837, "text": "- You're welcome, hey!"}, {"start": 975.837, "end": 976.677, "text": "- Let's do a clip show."}, {"start": 976.677, "end": 977.517, "text": "Bottle episode."}, {"start": 977.517, "end": 978.357, "text": "Don't forget the clip show."}, {"start": 978.357, "end": 979.177, "text": "- Harrison Ford."}, {"start": 979.177, "end": 980.017, "text": "- Remember when we went camping?"}, {"start": 980.017, "end": 980.857, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 980.857, "end": 981.697, "text": "- Remember when we painted the nursery?"}, {"start": 981.697, "end": 982.537, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 982.537, "end": 983.377, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 983.377, "end": 984.2170000000001, "text": "- Remember when we remembered going camping"}, {"start": 984.2170000000001, "end": 985.057, "text": "while we were in the nursery?"}, {"start": 985.057, "end": 987.557, "text": "(groaning)"}, {"start": 987.557, "end": 991.277, "text": "- I'm a millionaire, I'm an inventor, I'm a legend."}, {"start": 991.277, "end": 992.917, "text": "- And I had sex with a kid."}, {"start": 992.917, "end": 994.2370000000001, "text": "- It's sad."}, {"start": 994.2370000000001, "end": 995.677, "text": "- Should we increase their lithium?"}, {"start": 995.677, "end": 997.077, "text": "- Not yet."}, {"start": 997.077, "end": 999.4970000000001, "text": "I want to see what happens if we confiscate"}, {"start": 999.4970000000001, "end": 1000.577, "text": "one of their pens."}, {"start": 1000.577, "end": 1003.4970000000001, "text": "(thunder rumbling)"}, {"start": 1006.297, "end": 1009.137, "text": "- It's not possible."}, {"start": 1010.517, "end": 1014.277, "text": "- You say you started as a Spanish study group."}, {"start": 1014.277, "end": 1015.837, "text": "Do any of you speak Spanish?"}, {"start": 1015.837, "end": 1018.037, "text": "- (speaking foreign language)"}, {"start": 1018.037, "end": 1019.917, "text": "- And you've attended Greendell for three years,"}, {"start": 1019.917, "end": 1022.7170000000001, "text": "but don't community colleges end after two?"}, {"start": 1022.7170000000001, "end": 1024.557, "text": "- Everyone's always saying that."}, {"start": 1024.557, "end": 1027.057, "text": "- The average community college student attends school"}, {"start": 1027.057, "end": 1028.377, "text": "five to seven years."}, {"start": 1028.377, "end": 1029.877, "text": "Many offer four year degrees."}, {"start": 1029.877, "end": 1031.797, "text": "- In your mind they do."}, {"start": 1031.797, "end": 1032.997, "text": "In your mind."}, {"start": 1032.997, "end": 1035.997, "text": "And you've shared this delusion with each other."}, {"start": 1035.997, "end": 1038.477, "text": "Like that time all those people got into swing dance music"}, {"start": 1038.477, "end": 1041.1970000000001, "text": "back in the 90s, and then you were released."}, {"start": 1041.1970000000001, "end": 1042.877, "text": "Probably because your insurance ran out."}, {"start": 1042.877, "end": 1045.377, "text": "But the official story is that you're now fit"}, {"start": 1045.377, "end": 1047.877, "text": "to live within society again."}, {"start": 1047.877, "end": 1051.037, "text": "You just have to accept the truth."}, {"start": 1061.917, "end": 1062.757, "text": "- Wait."}, {"start": 1063.917, "end": 1065.577, "text": "Give me a break."}, {"start": 1065.577, "end": 1067.477, "text": "That made no sense."}, {"start": 1067.477, "end": 1068.637, "text": "- Yeah, it's me."}, {"start": 1068.637, "end": 1070.077, "text": "No, I think they bought it."}, {"start": 1070.077, "end": 1071.437, "text": "I had to do a little ripping at the end,"}, {"start": 1071.437, "end": 1073.277, "text": "but I was pretty convincing."}, {"start": 1074.637, "end": 1076.957, "text": "Well, if it looks like I'm sneaking out the window,"}, {"start": 1076.957, "end": 1079.597, "text": "it's just a symptom of your deepening psychosis."}, {"start": 1079.597, "end": 1080.437, "text": "Don't hurt me."}, {"start": 1080.437, "end": 1082.1570000000002, "text": "- Greendell doesn't exist."}, {"start": 1082.1570000000002, "end": 1083.477, "text": "How long do you think we'd buy that?"}, {"start": 1083.477, "end": 1085.637, "text": "- I'm literally carrying a Greendell back."}, {"start": 1085.637, "end": 1087.017, "text": "- I have like a thousand pictures of the campus"}, {"start": 1087.017, "end": 1087.857, "text": "on my phone."}, {"start": 1087.857, "end": 1088.957, "text": "- I have children I see every day."}, {"start": 1088.957, "end": 1091.037, "text": "I have definitely not been locked up."}, {"start": 1091.037, "end": 1092.637, "text": "- Get him!"}, {"start": 1092.637, "end": 1095.277, "text": "- Why would you lie to make us think we were crazy?"}, {"start": 1095.277, "end": 1096.4965555555557, "text": "- Because, Ms."}, {"start": 1096.4965555555557, "end": 1099.1970000000001, "text": "Edison, Greendell is purgatory."}, {"start": 1099.1970000000001, "end": 1100.557, "text": "And I am the devil."}, {"start": 1100.557, "end": 1101.397, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 1101.397, "end": 1102.717, "text": "- You knew it."}, {"start": 1102.717, "end": 1104.837, "text": "- Stop letting him make you realize stuff."}, {"start": 1105.957, "end": 1107.117, "text": "- These aren't even good lies."}, {"start": 1107.117, "end": 1107.957, "text": "- All right, fine."}, {"start": 1107.957, "end": 1108.877, "text": "I had to come up with something."}, {"start": 1108.877, "end": 1109.837, "text": "You were getting too close."}, {"start": 1109.837, "end": 1110.6770000000001, "text": "- Close to what?"}, {"start": 1110.6770000000001, "end": 1111.817, "text": "- To the truth."}, {"start": 1111.817, "end": 1112.957, "text": "The Indian kid was right."}, {"start": 1112.957, "end": 1113.797, "text": "- He's Arabic."}, {"start": 1113.797, "end": 1114.917, "text": "- Also Polish, whatever."}, {"start": 1114.917, "end": 1117.117, "text": "I'm a fake psychiatrist, not a fake ethnologist."}, {"start": 1117.117, "end": 1119.637, "text": "The point is your dean was kidnapped by Ben Chang"}, {"start": 1119.637, "end": 1121.317, "text": "and replaced with a double."}, {"start": 1121.317, "end": 1122.6770000000001, "text": "I was hired to get you off the scent."}, {"start": 1122.6770000000001, "end": 1124.397, "text": "- Chang kidnapped the dean?"}, {"start": 1124.397, "end": 1125.717, "text": "- Even for him, that's insane."}, {"start": 1125.717, "end": 1126.597, "text": "- Is it?"}, {"start": 1126.597, "end": 1127.557, "text": "Think about it."}, {"start": 1127.557, "end": 1130.237, "text": "(woman humming)"}, {"start": 1134.917, "end": 1137.237, "text": "- Whoa, I said I'm dead!"}, {"start": 1139.117, "end": 1142.037, "text": "- Chang, what are you doing?"}, {"start": 1142.037, "end": 1143.637, "text": "- I'm predicting future crimes."}, {"start": 1144.717, "end": 1145.877, "text": "Now I'm sick!"}, {"start": 1145.877, "end": 1148.037, "text": "- See, you said that would happen."}, {"start": 1148.037, "end": 1149.557, "text": "You are a precog."}, {"start": 1151.557, "end": 1152.397, "text": "(gun fires)"}, {"start": 1152.397, "end": 1154.557, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 1159.397, "end": 1160.237, "text": "Again."}, {"start": 1161.877, "end": 1162.717, "text": "(gun fires)"}, {"start": 1162.717, "end": 1164.557, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 1164.557, "end": 1166.277, "text": "- Ah, you're weak!"}, {"start": 1168.557, "end": 1171.277, "text": "- Uh, guys, while we were remembering Chang is crazy,"}, {"start": 1171.277, "end": 1172.6770000000001, "text": "the fake doctor sneaked away."}, {"start": 1172.6770000000001, "end": 1173.4592222222223, "text": "- No, crap!"}, {"start": 1173.4592222222223, "end": 1173.9569999999999, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 1173.9569999999999, "end": 1175.797, "text": "- There goes our only chance of clearing our names."}, {"start": 1175.797, "end": 1177.237, "text": "- You guys, forget about us."}, {"start": 1177.237, "end": 1178.877, "text": "The dean has been kidnapped."}, {"start": 1178.877, "end": 1181.4769999999999, "text": "He's out there somewhere alone and cold"}, {"start": 1181.4769999999999, "end": 1183.437, "text": "and most likely trying to cobble together"}, {"start": 1183.437, "end": 1185.077, "text": "a sexy Patty Hearst costume."}, {"start": 1185.077, "end": 1186.597, "text": "- Britta's right."}, {"start": 1186.597, "end": 1187.437, "text": "- Wait, what?"}, {"start": 1187.437, "end": 1188.757, "text": "- We need to rescue the dean."}, {"start": 1188.757, "end": 1190.077, "text": "- We need to get back to that school."}, {"start": 1190.077, "end": 1191.6770000000001, "text": "- And we definitely never need to do another paintball."}, {"start": 1191.6770000000001, "end": 1192.1293076923077, "text": "- Yeah?"}, {"start": 1192.1293076923077, "end": 1192.517, "text": "- See?"}, {"start": 1192.517, "end": 1193.6770000000001, "text": "Therapy does work."}, {"start": 1193.6770000000001, "end": 1194.517, "text": "- We're cured."}, {"start": 1199.237, "end": 1200.757, "text": "- Sounds like the study group has gotten"}, {"start": 1200.757, "end": 1202.397, "text": "wise to Operation Doppledeener."}, {"start": 1203.997, "end": 1205.717, "text": "Time for phase two."}, {"start": 1205.717, "end": 1206.557, "text": "- What's phase two?"}, {"start": 1206.557, "end": 1208.1170000000002, "text": "- Hey, I'm making up the same plan you are."}, {"start": 1208.1170000000002, "end": 1210.917, "text": "Come on, pitches, pitches, pitches."}, {"start": 1210.917, "end": 1211.877, "text": "- Thank you, Megan."}, {"start": 1215.5620000000001, "end": 1217.7620000000002, "text": "♪ Troy and I've been in the morning ♪"}, {"start": 1217.7620000000002, "end": 1219.002, "text": "- Nice."}, {"start": 1219.002, "end": 1220.362, "text": "- Welcome back all you night owls."}, {"start": 1220.362, "end": 1222.002, "text": "- Troy, why don't we open up the phone lines?"}, {"start": 1222.002, "end": 1223.2820000000002, "text": "- Talk to us lonely hearts."}, {"start": 1223.2820000000002, "end": 1224.3220000000001, "text": "- We got Jeff W."}, {"start": 1224.3220000000001, "end": 1224.842, "text": "calling."}, {"start": 1224.842, "end": 1226.002, "text": "- Hello?"}, {"start": 1226.002, "end": 1227.8020000000001, "text": "- Hey, Jeff, what's your question?"}, {"start": 1227.8020000000001, "end": 1228.7620000000002, "text": "- Who is this?"}, {"start": 1228.7620000000002, "end": 1230.2420000000002, "text": "- Great question, we're us."}, {"start": 1230.2420000000002, "end": 1232.482, "text": "- You guys, it's three in the morning."}, {"start": 1232.482, "end": 1234.5620000000001, "text": "I'm trying to sleep."}, {"start": 1234.5620000000001, "end": 1235.602, "text": "- I'm sorry to hear that, Jeff."}, {"start": 1235.602, "end": 1236.442, "text": "Why don't you stay on the line"}, {"start": 1236.442, "end": 1237.2820000000002, "text": "and we'll get your information."}, {"start": 1237.2820000000002, "end": 1239.002, "text": "- Yeah, we'll get you the help you need."}, {"start": 1239.002, "end": 1240.6420000000003, "text": "- Our next caller is Annie E."}, {"start": 1240.6420000000003, "end": 1241.882, "text": "What's on your mind tonight, Annie?"}, {"start": 1241.882, "end": 1245.122, "text": "- Hey guys, long time, first time, love the show."}, {"start": 1245.122, "end": 1246.7220000000002, "text": "- Appreciate ya, how can we help?"}, {"start": 1246.7220000000002, "end": 1247.922, "text": "(banging)"}, {"start": 1247.922, "end": 1249.7220000000002, "text": "- You can set up this honestly!"}, {"start": 1253.292, "end": 1254.652, "text": "- Well, Jackson Jills, that's about all the time"}, {"start": 1254.652, "end": 1255.4920000000002, "text": "we have tonight."}, {"start": 1255.4920000000002, "end": 1257.5720000000001, "text": "- Yeah, until next time, may your dreams be sweet"}, {"start": 1257.5720000000001, "end": 1259.692, "text": "and your nightmares be spooky, monster-scary"}, {"start": 1259.692, "end": 1261.652, "text": "and not grandma-dyed-scary."}, {"start": 1261.652, "end": 1263.892, "text": "♪ Tryin' out bed in the morning ♪"}, {"start": 1263.892, "end": 1266.412, "text": "♪ Nights ♪"}, {"start": 1266.412, "end": 1269.412, "text": "(glasses clinking)"}]}